cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "LernWerkstatt"
abstract: >-
  LernWerkstatt generates interactive, self-contained HTML learning units with
  a large language model. The scope of a unit is derived from the gap between
  a learner's prior knowledge and goal; generated content is normalised,
  validated and repaired deterministically before delivery.
authors:
  - family-names: "Dreyer"
    given-names: "Malte"
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/maltedreyer-5/lernwerkstatt"
keywords:
  - learning units
  - instructional design
  - large language models
  - open educational resources
